# CQ: What obligations regarding quality management systems or an equivalent function under relevant sectoral Union law apply to the provider? How are the aspects listed in paragraph 1 included as part of the quality management systems pursuant to that law?
# Question: lexreq:aiact-art17-3-cq1
# Requirement: lexreq:aiact-art17-3
# Terms: aidoc-lex:integratedWith, aidoc:AIProvider, aidoc:appliesStandard

PREFIX aidoc: <https://w3id.org/aidoc-ap#>
PREFIX aidoc-lex: <https://w3id.org/aidoc-ap/lex#>
SELECT ?provider ?system ?other WHERE {
  ?provider a aidoc:AIProvider ;
            aidoc-lex:hasManagementSystem ?system .
  ?other aidoc-lex:integratedWith ?system .
}
